section: compiler
synopsis: Speed up command line parser with a trie map
description:
  Parsing flags is now faster when there are many flags to parse.

  There is a new trie implementation with String keys in ``GHC.Data.StringTrie``.

  Added a new abstract type ``FlagSpecTrie`` to represent tries of flags.

  ``GHC.Driver.Session`` gets ``flagsDynamic`` removed and ``flagsDynamicTrie``
  added with type ``FlagSpecTrie``. ``processCmdLineP`` and ``parseDynamicFlagsFull``
  now have a ``FlagSpecTrie`` parameter instead of a list.

  ``GHC.Driver.Session.Mode`` gets a value ``mode_flags_trie`` of type ``FlagSpecTrie``.

  ``GHC.Driver.CmdLine.processArgs`` now gets a ``FlagSpecTrie`` argument instead
  of a list.
